    {
      "parameters": {
        "content": "## 10 · Book Appointment\nThree layers against double-booking: (1) the slot must be one we **offered** this lead,\n(2) idempotency check on (lead, start) + live `freeBusy` re-check, (3) the DB exclusion constraint\n`appt_no_overlap` — if it fires, the Google event is rolled back and fresh alternatives are returned.\nReschedule = book new → mark old RESCHEDULED → delete old Google event.",
        "width": 620,
        "height": 260
      },
      "id": "a9d4a995-af03-4313-8bf2-3ad32c6dcbb8",
